'''Las Peñas''' ({{Literal translation|the rocks|the cliffs}}; {{Langx|scn|Li Ruccàzzi}}; [[Malerno|Malernian]]: ''Ix-Xniexel'') is one of ten regions of [[Hesperia]], within the [[Baliscan Confederation]]. It is bordered by [[Campostella]] to the northwest, [[Piedmont]] to the southwest, [[Guarapiranga]] to the northeast, and the [[W:South Atlantic|South Atlantic Ocean]] to the east. It has an area of {{convert|10648|km2|abbr=on}} making it the 37th largest region of Balisca. It had an estimated population of 2,067,648 in 2023. The capital is [[Portulegnu]], and its largest city is [[Cabo de Peñas]].

